<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Welcome! This platform was created to help international students navigate higher education in South Korea without the burden of heavy financial debt."
	pubDate={new Date('July 25 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Welcome! This platform was created to help international students navigate higher education in South Korea without the burden of heavy financial debt.
	</p>

	<p>
		While many prospective students only know about major government scholarships 
		like GKS, there are many direct pathways to study in Korea 
		with 100% tuition waivers, professor-funded lab stipends, and research assistantships.
	</p>

	<h2>My Mission</h2>
	<p>
		Navigating admissions, finding lab openings, and emailing professors can feel overwhelming. 
		My goal is to make this process transparent and accessible by providing:
	</p>

	<ul>
		<li><strong>Step-by-Step Roadmaps:</strong> Clear, actionable guides on application timelines and requirements.</li>
		<li><strong>Direct Funding Strategies:</strong> Practical advice on securing lab stipends (RA/TA) directly from professors.</li>
		<li><strong>Community Support:</strong> A space for prospective students to ask questions, share updates, and help each other succeed.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
	<p>
		Have questions or want to share feedback? Feel free to reach out via 
		<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/your-profile" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a> 
		or send an email directly to <strong>marhamidhatiey@gmail.com</strong>.
	</p>

	<p>
		You can also join the discussion on our <a href="/forum">Community Forum</a>!
	</p>
</Layout>